{"plan":{"about":"The audit plan the F1 Finance Audit Machine follows for the property, equipment and leases of the invented HANGS General Contracting LP, fiscal year 2026. The runner reads its rates and thresholds from here; the Asset Files system shows it. Every name and figure is invented.","engagement":"FY2026 Equipment and Leases Audit","entity":"HANGS General Contracting LP","period":"Fiscal year ended June 30, 2026","reader":"The partners, the bonding company and Ferncastle Bank read the year-end statements.","materiality":{"benchmark":"Contract revenue for the year","rate":"0.005","roundDownTo":10000,"performance":"0.75","trivial":"0.05","why":"A contractor's income swings with its job estimates, so revenue is the steadier benchmark. The engagement partner sets the final amounts for the whole audit; this area uses them."},"assertions":[{"assertion":"Existence","how":"Every addition vouched to the vendor's invoice; every asset on the register compared with the hours log"},{"assertion":"Accuracy and valuation","how":"Depreciation recomputed on every asset at the register's life and at the policy's class life; idle and listed assets reviewed for impairment"},{"assertion":"Classification","how":"Every invoice line read against the policy: a repair to an existing asset is an expense, not a cost"},{"assertion":"Authorization","how":"Every addition over the policy's approval amount traced to a signed capital expenditure request dated before the purchase"},{"assertion":"Completeness of leases","how":"Every rental agreement and the office lease tested against ASC 842: a lease, the short-term exemption, the classification, then the right-of-use asset and the lease liability recomputed"}],"procedures":[{"stage":"Plan the Area","what":"Agree the register's totals to the trial balance at both year ends, read the policy and propose materiality."},{"stage":"Roll Forward the Register","what":"Opening cost and accumulated depreciation, plus additions and depreciation, less the disposal, to the closing balances in the trial balance, account by account."},{"stage":"Vouch Additions and Disposals","what":"Every addition to its invoice and its signed request; every invoice line read for repairs; the disposal to the recycler's certificate."},{"stage":"Depreciation and Impairment","what":"Recompute every asset's depreciation, compare each register life with the policy's class life, and read the hours log for idle, listed or fully depreciated equipment still in use."},{"stage":"Test the Leases","what":"Read every rental and the office lease, decide which are leases, test the short-term exemption and the classification, and recompute the right-of-use assets and lease liabilities at the policy's rate."},{"stage":"Ready for the CPA","what":"Set what was found against materiality, list the open items and write the workpapers and the draft findings memo. The CPA concludes."}]},"entity":"HANGS General Contracting LP","folderName":"HANGS General Contracting - FY2026 Equipment and Leases Audit Files","period":"Fiscal year ended June 30, 2026","register":[{"asset":"BL-1001","description":"Shop and yard building, 4400 East Marginal Way S","cls":"Buildings","account":"1500","start":"2020-07-01","cost":"4600000.00","life":480,"accumulated":"690000.00","dep":"115000.00","nbv":"3910000.00","disposed":null},{"asset":"EQ-2740","description":"Crawler crane, 100-ton (2012)","cls":"Cranes and crane attachments","account":"1550","start":"2012-07-01","cost":"369460.33","life":120,"accumulated":"369460.33","dep":"0.00","nbv":"0.00","disposed":null},{"asset":"EQ-3102","description":"Concrete pump truck, 28-meter boom (2013)","cls":"Concrete pump trucks","account":"1550","start":"2013-05-01","cost":"300000.00","life":84,"accumulated":"0.00","dep":"0.00","nbv":"0.00","disposed":"2026-02-27"},{"asset":"EQ-3205","description":"Site office trailers (2)","cls":"Site office units","account":"1550","start":"2016-04-01","cost":"76800.00","life":120,"accumulated":"76800.00","